thers have arrived in the elven homeland of Romca, the Land of Wind where he plans to marry Nefritis, princess of the Ring of Wind. Due to her shy nature, Nefritis vehemently refuses her marriage to Satou.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/77QAWhmyAesl0lS88eOQkECiQKV.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/77QAWhmyAesl0lS88eOQkECiQKV.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218493/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"5000997","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the belief that the Abyss King's armies are closing in, Alabaster suggests they postpone Satou's marriage to Nefritis and head to another country. As they're departing an Abyss King's knight makes it past the barrier and attacks Romca.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-01-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xbcJpMzrLmrOmVuFRw0sQOOPFBh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xbcJpMzrLmrOmVuFRw0sQOOPFBh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218493/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"5000998","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Satou and company continue their journey for the next ring. Hime becomes jealous of Satou taking care of Nephritis. Soon after, a large caravan appears before them which is the Land of Fire, Needakitta. They ask for an audience with the princess, but...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-03","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s6A2toFoX32cxKhr17mEwtZGTqw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/s6A2toFoX32cxKhr17mEwtZGTqw.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218493/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"5000999","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Satou trains with Marse, hoping to beat Granart in the sword duel to court her. Satou is torn between facing her fairly to look cool for Hime, and prioritizing his duty as the Ring King. However, the Abyss King's evil clutches are approaching Needakitta.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-10","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hM2qRGfxZ2OgxAxPMviyhbJMHEm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hM2qRGfxZ2OgxAxPMviyhbJMHEm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218493/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"5001000","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Satou visits Maasa, the Land of Water, and unexpectedly ends up marrying Saphir, the Ring Princess. Saphir believes she needs the Ring King's power to save her homeland from being controlled by the Gisaras Empire.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b0zidUUlG2h9ZKryNKXuhB925VN.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b0zidUUlG2h9ZKryNKXuhB925VN.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/218493/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"5001001","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The oracle who's secretly running Maasa the Land of Water offers some advice to Marse who failed in his mission. Satou and Sluder prepare to repel the approaching Abyss King's horde. As Satou struggles, a certain person suddenly stands before him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2024-02-24","language":"it-IT"},"run